{
 "brief": "The Izz ad-Din al-Qassam Brigades, the military wing of Hamas, released footage of slain commander Ibrahim Ahmed al-Biara, known as \"Abu Suhaib,\" according to Shehab Wire. Al-Biara led the Martyr Fawzi Abu al-Qura Battalion within the northern brigade. The video documented his oversight of fighter preparations ahead of what the group termed Operation Al-Aqsa Flood.\n\nThe footage appears part of Hamas's broader effort to memorialize senior military figures who have died during the Gaza conflict. The release preserves images and records of battlefield command structure and operational planning during the period preceding the major military campaign.",
